 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch04-02-03\"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id1322516\" data-alt=\"On the left, a sphere 1 mm in diameter is encased in a box of the same width. On the right, the same sphere is encased in a box 2 mm in diameter.\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/14ba36d6303880b2bd0105de67916a279cf2b014\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"On the left, a sphere 1 mm in diameter is encased in a box of the same width. On the right, the same sphere is encased in a box 2 mm in diameter.\" width=\"350\" height=\"117\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
